    <string name="rabies_awareness">🐾 Rabies Awareness</string>
    <string name="what_is_rabies">What is Rabies?</string>
    <string name="rabies_is_a_deadly_viral_disease_that_attacks_the_brain_and_nerves">"Rabies is a deadly viral disease that attacks the brain and nerves. "</string>
    <string name="once_symptoms_appear_it_is_almost_always_fatal_but_timely_treatment_can_prevent_it">Once symptoms appear, it is almost always fatal, but timely treatment can prevent it.</string>
    <string name="cause">Cause</string>
    <string name="caused_by_the_rabies_virus_found_in_the_saliva_of_infected_animals">"Caused by the rabies virus found in the saliva of infected animals. "</string>
    <string name="in_india_dogs_are_the_most_common_source_but_cats_monkeys_and_wild_animals_can_also_spread_rabies">In India, dogs are the most common source, but cats, monkeys, and wild animals can also spread rabies.</string>
    <string name="how_people_get_infected">How People Get Infected?</string>
    <string name="bite_or_scratch_from_a_rabid_animal">• Bite or scratch from a rabid animal\n</string>
    <string name="saliva_or_lick_on_broken_skin_or_eyes_mouth_or_nose">• Saliva or lick on broken skin or eyes, mouth, or nose\n</string>
    <string name="handling_infected_animals_without_protection">• Handling infected animals without protection</string>
    <string name="signs_of_rabid_animals">Signs of Rabid Animals</string>
    <string name="unusual_aggression_or_excessive_drooling">• Unusual aggression or excessive drooling\n</string>
    <string name="difficulty_walking_biting_objects_or_sudden_behavior_changes">• Difficulty walking, biting objects, or sudden behavior changes\n</string>
    <string name="even_healthy_looking_animals_can_carry_rabies_always_treat_bites_seriously">• Even healthy-looking animals can carry rabies — always treat bites seriously</string>
    <string name="categories_of_exposure">Categories of Exposure</string>
    <string name="category_i_touching_or_feeding_animals_licks_on_intact_skin_no_treatment_needed">• Category I: Touching or feeding animals, licks on intact skin → No treatment needed\n\n</string>
    <string name="category_ii_minor_scratches_nibbles_without_bleeding_rabies_vaccine_required">• Category II: Minor scratches/nibbles without bleeding → Rabies vaccine required\n\n</string>
    <string name="category_iii_deep_bites_scratches_saliva_on_broken_skin_bites_on_face_neck_hands_rabies_vaccine_rabies_immunoglobulin_required">• Category III: Deep bites/scratches, saliva on broken skin, bites on face/neck/hands → Rabies vaccine + Rabies immunoglobulin required</string>
    <string name="first_aid_act_immediately">First Aid – Act Immediately!</string>
    <string name="_1_wash_the_wound_with_plenty_of_soap_and_running_water_for_at_least_15_minutes">1. Wash the wound with plenty of soap and running water for at least 15 minutes.\n</string>
    <string name="_2_apply_antiseptic_povidone_iodine_or_alcohol_based">2. Apply antiseptic (povidone-iodine or alcohol-based).\n</string>
    <string name="_3_do_not_apply_irritants_chili_turmeric_oils_or_cover_tightly">3. Do NOT apply irritants (chili, turmeric, oils) or cover tightly.\n</string>
    <string name="_4_visit_the_nearest_hospital_or_anti_rabies_clinic_immediately">4. Visit the nearest hospital or anti-rabies clinic immediately.</string>
    <string name="treatment_schedule">Treatment Schedule</string>
    <string name="rabies_vaccination_pep_day_0_3_7_28_day_0_first_injection_intradermal_or_day_0_3_7_14_28_day_0_first_injection_intramuscular">• Rabies Vaccination (PEP): Day 0, 3, 7, 28 (Day 0 = first injection) (Intradermal) or Day 0, 3, 7, 14, 28 (Day 0 = first injection) (Intramuscular)\n\n</string>
    <string name="rabies_immunoglobulin_rig_for_severe_category_iii_bites_injected_into_and_around_the_wound_as_soon_as_possible">• Rabies Immunoglobulin (RIG): For severe Category III bites; injected into and around the wound as soon as possible\n\n</string>
    <string name="tetanus_injection_may_also_be_required">• Tetanus injection may also be required\n\n</string>
    <string name="complete_all_doses_even_if_the_wound_heals_or_the_animal_appears_healthy">Complete all doses even if the wound heals or the animal appears healthy.</string>
    <string name="prevention">Prevention</string>
